1d:["$","section","experiments",{"id":"experiments","children":[[["$","span","results",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"results"}],["$","span","observation",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"observation"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"07"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Experiments & Claims"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"Research Question → Experiment → Answer"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Question：Curriculum、Skill Library 和反馈修订是否帮助开放探索？→ Experiment：比较物品获取、探索范围、里程碑速度，做组件消融，并在新世界复用技能。→ Answer：作者报告组件组合带来收益和一定迁移；这些指标测量游戏环境内的能力积累，没有单独证明 Skill Generator 自身的改进策略被更新。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Voyager: An Open-Ended Embodied Agent with Large Language Models · v2","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"论文报告更丰富的物品发现与更快的里程碑达成，并展示 skill library 在新世界中的迁移。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Voyager: An Open-Ended Embodied Agent with Large Language Models · v2","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
